# DP-408: /app must not be a git repo. agy (and any other agent CLI) walks up
# from its cwd to the repository root — persona workspaces lived under
# /app/data/workspaces, so a shipped /app/.git made every agy call load derpr's
# own dev instructions and treat the derpr codebase as its workspace. DP-410
# moved the data volume to /data; this stays because an image run without
# DATA_DIR still falls back to /app/data. Nothing at runtime reads /app/.git;
# self_edit and the notes workspace use their own clones under the data dir.
# CLAUDE.md stays: notes_workspace.seed_claude_md copies it
# into cc-* persona workspaces (DP-314).
.git
.agents/

# Never in a CI checkout (gitignored), but a local `docker build` would copy
# them: the private notes repo and other tasks' worktrees.
memory/
worktrees/
